Z||000000||skitime||11-02-2001||08:16 PM||||This is a interesting list from the Pontiac Fiero 22P Parts Catalog-Accessories pages 21-1 to 21-3.  Wish some of these were still available.<P>Battery Rescue Package<BR>Emergency Cleaning Cloth<BR>Remote Cassette Player Package<BR>Mirror Covers<BR>Front End Cover<BR>Decal Package (Currently for sale on EBAY)<BR>Rear Window Defogger<BR>Fire Extinguiser<BR>Safety Flare Pkg<BR>Fender Splash Guard Pkg<BR>Trailer Wiring Harness with heavy duty flasher<BR>Headlight Buzzer<BR>Engine Heater Pkg<BR>Highway Emergency Pkg<BR>KOOLATRON Electic Ice Chest<BR>Vehicle Security Digital Keyboard Pkg<BR>Fog/Driving Lamp Pkg<BR>Keyless GM Vehicle Battery Pkg<BR>Portable Spotlight Pkg<BR>High Level Stop Lamp Pkg<BR>License Plate Frame Pkg<BR>Wheel Nut Pkg<BR>Mirror Pkg (Electro Chromic Automatic Elec Day/Night)<BR>Radio Reciever Cable Pkg<BR>Radio Pkg (CB 40 Channel)<BR>License Plate Protector Pkg<BR>Security System Pkg<BR>Vehicle Security Shock Sensor Pkg (for above)<BR>Vehicle Security Siren<BR>Vehicle Security Hood Lock<BR>Jumper Cable Pkg<BR>Radio Speaker Pkg<BR>Portable Tool Kit<BR>Battery Warmer Pkg<P> <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-2.JPG"> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||Monkeyman||11-03-2001||01:42 AM||||Sometimes the 22P is kind of generic in that it seems to list parts for other vehicles.  Some of those accessories we have.<P>Front End Cover--You could order a Fiero with a bra.  But just like on a T/A, etc it was very expensive.<P>Rear Window Defogger--There are plenty of Fieros with that option.<P>Fender Splash Guard Pkg--I'll bet that's just mud guards.<P>Headlight Buzzer=blue dingy thingy<P>Engine Heater Pkg--I'm sure I've read that some (possibly just Canadian?) Fieros had a block heater.<P>High Level Stop Lamp Pkg=3<sup>rd</sup> brake light.<P>License Plate Frame Pkg--I'm guessing you could get one of those that 'Fiero' or just 'GM'.<P>Wheel Nut Pkg--Umm...I've got 20 on mine.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Security System Pkg--Didn't some '88s come with a factory alarm system?<P>Radio Speaker Pkg--I've had 4 speakers in each of my '86s and 6 speakers in my '85.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
